    "group": "Annihilation Legion",
    "summary": "When a **DESTROYER CULT** or **FLAYED ONES** unit of yours declares a charge, you may re-roll its **Charge roll**, with +1 to that roll if at least 1 target of the charge is **Below Half-strength**.\n\nRanged attacks by your **DESTROYER CULT** units aimed at the closest eligible target improve their Armour Penetration by 1.",
